                <a href="#">Data Stealing Attacks in Federated Learning for Satellite Communication Systems</a>
                <p class="project-desc">
                  Investigated vulnerabilities of federated learning models in satellite communication systems to data stealing attacks (model
                  inversion, membership inference)..
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <img src="{{ site.baseurl }}/assets/img/abc.jpg" class="zoomable area-icon" onclick="openZoom(this)">
              <div>
                <a href="#">Federated Unlearning Attack</a>
