              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="research-category">
        <h4><b>Medical Imaging:</b></h4>
        <div class="category-scroll">
          <ol>
            <li>
              <img src="#" class="zoomable area-icon" onclick="openZoom(this)">
              <div>
                <a href="#">LLM-Driven Question Answering and Captioning for 3D CT and MRI Data (pdf)</a>
                <p class="project-desc">
                  A vision encoder to extract feature embedding of 3D brain MRI and abdominal CT volume data and context alignment via question
                  answering and captioning through Large Language Model (LLM/VLM, Qwen-4B)
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <img src="#" class="zoomable area-icon" onclick="openZoom(this)">
              <div>
                <a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/11022489"
                  >Organ-Seg: A Vision-Language and LLM-Enhanced Framework for User-Guided Abdominal Organ Segmentation.</a
                >
                <p class="project-desc">
                  Instruction-guided medical image segmentation framework that combines LLaVA and SAM to deliver accurate, context-aware, and
